    "created_at": "2016-05-20T13:40:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-20T13:40:09Z",
    "body": "Yeah that makes sense. `ImageBitmapSource` is only used by an asynchronous API so it can have asynchronous sources.\n\nI take it you have no objections to defining it in terms of `CanvasImageSource` plus these two types?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
